# TailwindCSS best practices

- If there is a new property not yet defined, configure it in the [eslint.config.js](mdc:eslint.config.js) file.
- Always use TailwindCSS classes in `*.html`, do not create styles yourself in `*.css` files.

# Javascript best practices

- Always write javascript handling in the [main.js](mdc:src/assets/javascripts/main.js) file.
- When needing a new GSAP plugin, download it to the `src/assets/javascripts` folder, then import it in the `*.html` file where it's needed.
